**Core Principle:** Trace → Prove → Fix → Verify

---

## When to Activate DEBUGGER Protocol

| Trigger | Action |
|---------|--------|
| Task fails with error | Activate immediately |
| Agent reports certainty < 60% | Peer agent activates as DEBUGGER |
